# Overhaust configuration
# OVERHAUST_DB_PATH - override default SQLite location (default: <project>/data/overhaust_memory.db)
# OVERHAUST_API_HOST - API bind host (default: 0.0.0.0)
# OVERHAUST_API_PORT - API server port (default: 8000)
# OVERHAUST_API_BASE_URL - client URL for demos/API connection (default: http://localhost:8000)
# OVERHAUST_ALLOWED_ORIGINS - comma-separated CORS origins (default: localhost dev ports)
# OVERHAUST_DEFAULT_MODEL - token estimation model (default: gpt-4)
# OVERHAUST_EMBEDDINGS - enable hybrid semantic retrieval (0=off default, 1=on)
# OVERHAUST_EMBEDDING_MODEL - fastembed model id (default: BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5)
# OVERHAUST_HYBRID_KEYWORD_WEIGHT - hybrid fusion weight (default: 0.50)
# OVERHAUST_HYBRID_SEMANTIC_WEIGHT - hybrid fusion weight (default: 0.35)
